NODE id=github.com/paxlabs-inc/layerx/internal/settle.buildWithdrawalGroup kind=func
  digest=b3:1121ded56239f39a6c99679449522c578df4ef755c25066f08d8f47c7b42fa81 file=layerx/internal/settle/settle.go range=290:313 lang=go exported=false byte_range=10471:11672
  sig=func buildWithdrawalGroup(payable []store.QueuedWithdrawal) (rootHex string, items []store.SealedWithdrawal, deltas []chain.NetDelta)
  doc=buildWithdrawalGroup turns a payable withdrawal set into the on-chain inputs:\nit sorts by id (deterministic leaf order), computes the payout root, and\nproduces the seal items + chain deltas. Pure (no I/O), so the commitment +\nidempotency are unit-testable. Returns ("", ...) when there is nothing\npayable.
